  "verdict": "Option A remains the best path, but it is not closed. The RP3 coexact tower is nonzero; the volume-weighted half determinant nearly equals the existing pi^-4 term; the P02/Casimir rank-10 correction reduces the mismatch to the 3e-6 relative level. However, the rank required for exact equality is 10.0099700224, not an integer, and no external lens-space determinant formula checked here derives the S2T rank-10 mixed trace. Therefore Tome II must keep S_vac at conditional determinant success unless a full L(2,1) Maxwell--ghost mixed-trace derivation is added."
